    "@id": "https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/source/value-stream-commercial-lifecycle"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "Execute the final sale to the end consumer at branded retail sites, securely process payments, and capture granular transaction data. Applicability: where independent jobbers and dealers run the sites, as at MPC since it sold its company-operated retail in 2021 (MPC FY2025 Form 10-K, Item 1), they make the sale and set the pump price; for the brand owner this process is an external interface, not one it performs; the scope note is Claude's, under the delegation (EPM-DEC-001-0047, MPC-P07)."
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation": [
   {
